              "arm_2_role": "Comparator: no active cerebral NIRS-guided management, including usual/standard care without NIRS use or masked/blinded NIRS recordings not available for clinical decisions.",
              "comparison_rationale": "This is the broad main review contrast and combines the recurring source-reported control variants because they share the same review-level role: clinicians do not use cerebral NIRS values to guide treatment. Important heterogeneity includes whether the control had no NIRS sensor versus blinded NIRS, timing and duration of monitoring, treatment thresholds, and whether the report is a parent trial or ancillary subset.",
