            "official_title": "Avoiding Hypotension in Preterm Neonates (AHIP) - A Randomised Controlled Study on Near Infrared Spectroscopy Monitoring of Peripheral-muscle and Cerebral Oxygenation With Defined Interventions Versus Routine Monitoring and Treatment in Preterm Neonates",
