            "fulltext_eligibility_decision": "include",
            "fulltext_eligibility_reason": "Include. The full text reports original analyses from the SafeBoosC II multicentre randomized trial in extremely preterm infants, comparing visible cerebral NIRS monitoring plus a treatment guideline with blinded NIRS collection plus usual care. This paper's main analyses are post hoc associations between oxygenation burden and biomarkers/outcomes rather than the primary randomized treatment effect, so extraction for the target comparison may require the parent SafeBoosC II results paper for complete arm-level effect data; however, the full text establishes eligibility and reports relevant outcomes.",
            "study_table_focused_source_status": "used",
            "study_table_focused_source_chars": 9358,
            "study_table_focused_source_task_count": 3,
            "visual_assets_count": 3,
